# Implementation Plan - Sidebar Restructuring

The goal is to reorder the sidebar navigation across the application to:
1.  Dashboard
2.  Calculations
3.  Manage Data
4.  Reports
5.  Reference Data
6.  Uncertainty
7.  Compliance

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/manage-data.html), [settings.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.html), and [profile.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/profile.html) currently use a different layout and do NOT have the main sidebar. This plan only updates pages that *already* display the main sidebar.

## Proposed Changes

### Global Sidebar Updates
All files containing `<aside class="sidebar">` will have their navigation list updated.

#### [MODIFY] Public HTML Files
Reorder the `<li>` items in the sidebar `<ul class="nav-links">`.
The `active` class will be correctly assigned based on the file.

**Affected Files:**
1.  [dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.html) (Active: Dashboard)
2.  [emission-selection.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/emission-selection.html) + all calculators (`stationary...`, `mobile...` etc.) (Active: Calculations)
3.  [reports.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/reports.html) (Active: Reports)
4.  [reference-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/reference-data.html) (Active: Reference Data)
5.  [uncertainty.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/uncertainty.html) (Active: Uncertainty)
6.  [compliance.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/compliance.html) (Active: Compliance)

